  "description": "YITAMOTOR Running Boards Fit for 2015-2025 Ford F-150 SuperCrew Cab Side Steps | Nerf Bar. They are made of anti-corrosion stainless steel with UV-resistant non-slip step pads. Get in and out of your truck with ease with these running boards.\nFitment\n2015-2026 Ford F150 SuperCrew Cab Pickup 4-Door\n2017-2026 Ford F-250 F-350 Super Duty Crew Cab\nNote: Please ensure these side step bars fit your Truck before purchase\nFeatures\nIMPORTANT - This running board side step is compatible with the 2015-2026 Ford F-150 SuperCrew Cab & 2017-2026 Ford F-250, F-350 Super Duty Crew Cab. Not for Super Cab with 2 full-size front doors and 2 shortened rear doors. Please check the Cab Size picture before ordering\nPRACTICAL DESIGN - 6\" wide stylish black stainless steel pad provides a textured surface for comfortable footing. Each side can support up to 450 lb\nSUPER QUALITY - The running boards' structure provides strength and durability. The 6-inch non-slip injection step pad allows easy movement such as stepping in, stepping out, and even jumping (450 lb. capacity)\nSUPREME FUNCTIONALITY - Made from Stainless Steel and pre-treated with rust-resistant powder coatings. One-piece design ensures great performance and looks for years to come\nEASY TO INSTALL - Easy bolt-on installation with no drilling required. All factory holes are perfectly aligned with the mounts; bolts to factory mount in less than an hour\nProfessional installation recommended",
